<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέξ-ειμι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶμι</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ibo) go out through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεξίμεναι πεδίονδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.393
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ αὐλῆς ἐς</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.148
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>go through, pass through</i> a country, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῆς Λιβύης τὰ ἄνω</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Μιλησίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ πάσης Εὐρώπης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ παντὸς τοῦ σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.49
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώραν, τόπον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.25.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.149a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>traverse the whole length of</i> a line, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1174a34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in counting
			or recounting, <i>go through in detail, relate circumstantially,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.77
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					5.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				361e
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>go through,</i> by way of examining, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1024
			</span></i>; <i>expound,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>; <i>deliver,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκώμιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
